# Historical managed-functions reference only. Spark booking uses NO server variables.
# Active Spark setup: docs/firebase-spark-booking.md. Do not enable billing or Functions.
# The preserved alternative runs in Firebase Cloud Functions with managed credentials.
# Configure this public deploy-time parameter in functions/.env.ln-by-piya.
# The administrator must approve this identity and grant its reviewed IAM role.
BOOKING_RUNTIME_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=booking-runtime@ln-by-piya.iam.gserviceaccount.com
# Vercel needs only its existing browser Firebase configuration for booking.
# No private key JSON or Vercel OIDC token is required.
